    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u26a0\ufe0f\u2757\u2757 Important Notice: Location Permission Pop-Up \u2757\u2757\u26a0\ufe0f</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your continued support! We\u2019ve recently received a few reports about a location permission pop-up appearing in our games. If you see this prompt, feel free to <strong><i><u>decline it</u></i></strong>. The game should work just fine without needing any location data. Rest assured, we haven\u2019t programmed our games to request location access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re actively looking into what\u2019s causing this. For context, our games are built using the Construct 3 engine, which relies on HTML5 technology, and this might be related to the issue. One possibility (though we\u2019re not certain yet) is that a recent Windows update could be triggering these prompts for web-based applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter this pop-up, we\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you could take a screenshot and send it to us at <u>ub@noobzilla.games</u>. Your help will go a long way in helping us resolve this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding, and we apologize for any inconvenience. We truly value your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best regards,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UB</p></p><br><h1>\ud83c\udf81 Upcoming Game \ud83d\ude3b</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.poster.avif?t=1754297677\" width=800 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/9b846d80537cfd83dd3d2be20ae35cf5.webm?t=1754297677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><table><tr><th><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.poster.avif?t=1754297677\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.webm?t=1754297677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/d5b96aa7444e8d06249cd74c4b986369.mp4?t=1754297677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2764\ufe0f The 4th Cats and Seek series is here! We're off to <strong>Tokyo</strong> to find cats playing all around the city \ud83d\uddfc. Can you spot them all? \ud83d\ude3b<br><br>\ud83c\udfae 1 level :: \ud83d\ude3b 105 hidden cats :: \ud83c\udfc6 Achievements :: \ud83d\udcf7 Photo Mode <br>\ud83d\udd06 Adjustable Brightness :: \ud83c\udfa8 Pick Your Favorite Color :: \ud83d\udd14 Free Hints <br>\ud83d\udcbe Save System :: \ud83d\udd0d Zoom Feature :: \ud83d\udd09 Adorable Cat Sounds <br>\ud83c\udf81 DLC with +4 Levels &amp; +420 More Cats<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/6edd4c5d1e6ba5ec28a6c6d24c26d113.poster.avif?t=1754297677\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/6edd4c5d1e6ba5ec28a6c6d24c26d113.webm?t=1754297677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/6edd4c5d1e6ba5ec28a6c6d24c26d113.mp4?t=1754297677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/34d455d2d0aef7ba125a4f96b181c76c.poster.avif?t=1754297677\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/34d455d2d0aef7ba125a4f96b181c76c.webm?t=1754297677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/34d455d2d0aef7ba125a4f96b181c76c.mp4?t=1754297677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/c07e240ccc64fe4926f5ac46899187fd.poster.avif?t=1754297677\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925320/extras/c07e240ccc64fe4926f5ac46899187fd.gif?t=1754297677\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span> </p></th></tr></table>",
